","heroTalk":"TALK_HERO_MAIN","id":1102401,"initDialog":110240101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[10232],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/LQ/Zhongli1_11024/Q1102401","priority":0,"questId":11024,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":110240101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1034761882,"text":"前にも言ったが、孤雲閣の下には魔神たちが多く封印されている。","nextNodeIds":[110240102]},{"nodeId":110240102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":914339978,"text":"今の璃月は凡人たちのものだ。遠い昔に生きたヘウリアの「置き土産」を、璃月港に持ち帰るわけにはいかない。","nextNodeIds":[110240103]},{"nodeId":110240103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3899053650,"text":"ここで静かに眠らせた方がいい…","nextNodeIds":[110240104]},{"nodeId":110240104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1574744794,"text":"それで、何をすればいい？","nextNodeIds":[110240105]},{"nodeId":110240105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3862523506,"text":"俺は一つの時代を終わらせた。その歴史をどう記録すればいいか…ずっと考えていた。","nextNodeIds":[110240106]},{"nodeId":110240106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":64591138,"text":"歴史は記録できるが、その信憑性は不確かなものだ。今回の件はその証明になった。歴史を捻じ曲げるほど、時間の力とは強い…","nextNodeIds":[110240107]},{"nodeId":110240107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1897993906,"text":"本物の歴史を刻むために、より良い「記録」が必要だ。","nextNodeIds":[110240108]},{"nodeId":110240108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1363487946,"text":"石に刻むのは良い「記録」だった。しかし変わらない盤石も、世界も、俺も…いつか消えるかもしれない。","nextNodeIds":[110240109]},{"nodeId":110240109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":2321849850,"text":"鍾離…","nextNodeIds":[110240110]},{"nodeId":110240110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1898121354,"text":"だから、お前のことを思い浮かべたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[110240111]},{"nodeId":110240111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1259469146,"text":"お前は様々な世界を旅する者。歴史をお前の記憶に刻めば、それはいつか別の世界にも伝わるだろう。","nextNodeIds":[110240112]},{"nodeId":110240112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":731468634,"text":"旅人としてお前が「記録」すれば、テイワットの時代も歴史も、「バックアップ」を得たのと同じだ…","nextNodeIds":[110240113,110240115]},{"nodeId":110240113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1068905594,"text":"それが同行して欲しかった理由か。","nextNodeIds":[110240114]},{"nodeId":110240114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1485868050,"text":"任重くして道遠し、か。","nextNodeIds":[110240118]},{"nodeId":110240118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1929396530,"text":"さてと、そろそろ「置き土産」を海に入れるとするか。","nextNodeIds":[110240119]},{"nodeId":110240119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1182784538,"text":"ん？なんで海に入れるんだ？","nextNodeIds":[110240120]},{"nodeId":110240120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3994337258,"text":"言っただろう？ここには魔神が多く封印されていると。","nextNodeIds":[110240121]},{"nodeId":110240121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1328490978,"text":"「群玉閣」に再び封印された、あの「渦の魔神」オセルもな…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":110240115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3002406162,"text":"宝箱探しのためじゃなかったのか。","nextNodeIds":[110240116]},{"nodeId":110240116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":3814986626,"text":"ハハハッ…お前ならテイワットを出た後も、宝を見つけられるはずだ。","nextNodeIds":[110240117]},{"nodeId":110240117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":10232,"speakerName":"鍾離","textMapHash":1581743354,"text":"俺は「富の神」でもあるからな、効果には期待できるぞ。","nextNodeIds":[110240118]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1102401,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_CO